ro come\u00e7ar<\/span><span class=\"fr\"><i><\/i><i><\/i><i><\/i><i><\/i><\/span><span class=\"bx\"><span class=\"sh\"><\/span><span class=\"t1\">Quero come\u00e7ar<\/span><span class=\"t2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Quero come\u00e7ar<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/div><\/section><\/div>"},"elements":[]}],"isInner":true},{"id":"0a061d4","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0,"isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":0,"row":0}},"elements":[{"id":"cd6c885","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<div class=\"ff4-sec ff4-wrap\"><section id=\"metodo\" class=\"ff4-glass\" data-screen-label=\"07 Metodo Falconi\"><div class=\"ff4-col\" style=\"gap:14px\"><div class=\"ff4-eyebrow\">M\u00c9TODO FALCONI<\/div><h2 class=\"ff4-h2\">Cinco movimentos, uma transforma\u00e7\u00e3o<\/h2><p class=\"ff4-p\">Um processo estruturado e pr\u00f3prio, criado para conduzir cada pessoa da consci\u00eancia \u00e0 transforma\u00e7\u00e3o real.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"ff4-mq\"><div class=\"ff4-track\" id=\"ff4-track\"><div><div class=\"ff4-card\"><span class=\"c1\"><\/span><span class=\"c2\"><\/span><div class=\"big\">01<\/div><div class=\"ct\">CONSCI\u00caNCIA<\/div><div class=\"cd\">Entender onde voc\u00ea est\u00e1 e por qu\u00ea.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"ff4-card\"><span class=\"c1\"><\/span><span class=\"c2\"><\/span><div class=\"big\">02<\/div><div class=\"ct\">RAIZ<\/div><div class=\"cd\">Chegar \u00e0 origem dos padr\u00f5es que se repetem.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"ff4-card\"><span class=\"c1\"><\/span><span class=\"c2\"><\/span><div class=\"big\">03<\/div><div class=\"ct\">RESSIGNIFICA\u00c7\u00c3O<\/div><div class=\"cd\">Liberar o peso emocional que os sustenta.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"ff4-card\"><span class=\"c1\"><\/span><span class=\"c2\"><\/span><div class=\"big\">04<\/div><div class=\"ct\">RECONSTRU\u00c7\u00c3O<\